{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"よう(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中\n11thの制作が進んでますよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/02/05/4822998/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲\n今日初めて聴いたよ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回アンダー曲は特に\nすごい良い曲って言ってもらえることが多くて\n本当に嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/02/05/4822998/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいる理由とか咄嗟とかは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分達の声の入る前の状態を聴いて\n良い曲だと思うと同時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分達の声が入って印象変わったら\n曲のイメージ壊しちゃわないかな、とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく考えちゃうんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果、\nいつも高評価してもらえて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/02/05/4822998/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も\nいいシングルになりますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/02/05/4822998/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんの卒業が発表されました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんとは\n今まで二人でご飯に行ったりとかは\n無かったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年半一緒に活動してきたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何より\n素直で、友情に厚いせいたんが\n大好きだったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんの卒業は寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br